{"id":"gratuitement","lemma":"gratuitement","pos":"adv","rank":3564,"glosses":["freely, for free","without cause, gratuitously"],"ipa":"/ɡʁa.tɥit.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/14/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-gratuitement.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-gratuitement.wav.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Vous pouvez avoir ce livre gratuitement.","en":"You can have this book for nothing.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to have"},{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"book"},null]},{"text":"Je vous l'offre gratuitement.","en":"I'll give it to you for free.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"offer"},null]},{"text":"Tu peux l'obtenir gratuitement.","en":"You may get it free of charge.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"to get, to obtain"},null]},{"text":"Nous vous aiderons gratuitement.","en":"We'll help you for free.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to help","l":"aider"},null]},{"text":"J'ai reçu le billet gratuitement.","en":"I got the ticket for free.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to receive","l":"recevoir"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"note, a brief message"},null]}]}